<urn:fdo-squirrel:unpublished/freshford-st-lachtains-well-low-poly> a dcat:Dataset, crmdig:D1_Digital_Object, crm:E73_Information_Object, fdo:3DDataFDO ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy <urn:fdo-squirrel:activity/build> ;
    dct:description "Low resolution model of St. Lachtain's well in Freshford. The flower decorations were not there at my last few visits. A lady in the village told me that the water is supposed to heal sores. I would not recommend trying that, especially after the hedgehog has been floating in there for a while.\n\nWikidata: Q121840779\n\nSMR no: KK013-025----\n\nMade in KiriEngine from 156 images." ;
